{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19042","headline":"秋晚病中乐天以诗见问力疾奉酬 · 刘禹锡","name":"秋晚病中乐天以诗见问力疾奉酬","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"耳虚多听远，展传晨鸡鸣。\n一室背灯卧，中宵扫叶声。\n兰芳经雨败，鹤病得秋轻。\n肯踏衡门草，唯应是友生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19042.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19042","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}